# What a message between two emulations costs, in guest instructions at the host's
# plain JIT speed; for exact-busy-*, lockstep's slowdown times 1000 (tests/link/
# throughput.py; `meson compile -C build link-throughput-record` rewrites it).
# host-arch run figure
x86_64 bytes 527032
x86_64 exact 137119
x86_64 exact-busy-500us 7362
x86_64 exact-busy-50us 22446
x86_64 exact-busy-5us 205277
x86_64 free 184209
x86_64 loose 115862
x86_64 udp 115417
